"嬰齊","kind":"person","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m006-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"嬰齊","kind":"person","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m006-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"次公","kind":"person","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m006-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"嬰齊","kind":"person","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","book_id":"b-shiji-113","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p007","text":"太子興代立，其母為太后。太后自未為嬰齊姬時，嘗與霸陵人安國少季通。及嬰齊薨後，元鼎四年，漢使安國少季往諭王、王太后以入朝，比內諸侯；令辯士諫大夫終軍等宣其辭，勇士魏臣等輔其缺，衛尉路博德將兵屯桂陽，待使者。王年少，太後中國人也，嘗與安國少季通，其使復私焉。國人頗知之，多不附太后。太后恐亂起，亦欲倚漢威，數勸王及群臣求內屬。即因使者上書，請比內諸侯，三歲一朝，除邊關。於是天子許之，賜其丞相呂嘉銀印，及內史、中尉、太傅印，餘得自置。除其故黥劓刑，用漢法，比內諸侯。使者皆留填撫之。王、王太后飭治行裝重齎，為入朝具。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"興","kind":"person","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"嬰齊","kind":"person","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0027","start":27,"end":31,"surface":"安國少季","kind":"person","person_id":"u20_r6q_88g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"嬰齊","kind":"person","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0046","start":46,"end":50,"surface":"安國少季","kind":"pe