yue:m008-0230","start":230,"end":231,"surface":"嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"jfm_184_2yb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m008-0242","start":242,"end":244,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m008-0248","start":248,"end":249,"surface":"嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"jfm_184_2yb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m008-0252","start":252,"end":253,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m008-0254","start":254,"end":256,"surface":"太後","kind":"person","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m008-0257","start":257,"end":258,"surface":"嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"jfm_184_2yb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m008-0274","start":274,"end":275,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m008-0287","start":287,"end":288,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m008-0292","start":292,"end":293,"surface":"嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"jfm_184_2yb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m008-0294","start":294,"end":295,"surface":"嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"jfm_184_2yb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m008-0305","start":305,"end":307,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m008-0319","start":319,"end":320,"surface":"嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"jfm_184_2yb","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","book_id":"b-shiji-113","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009","text":"天子聞嘉不聽王，王、王太后弱孤不能制，使者怯無決。又以為王、王太后已附漢，獨呂嘉為亂，不足以興兵，欲使莊參以二千人往使。參曰：「以好往，數人足矣；以武往，二千人無足以為也。」辭不可，天子罷參也。郟壯士故濟北相韓千秋奮曰：「以區區之越，又有王、太后應，獨相呂嘉為害，願得勇士二百人，必斬嘉以報。」於是天子遣千秋與王太后弟樛樂將二千人往，入越境。呂嘉等乃遂反，下令國中曰：「王年少。太後，中國人也，又與使者亂，專欲內屬，盡持先王寶器入獻天子以自媚，多從人，行至長安，虜賣以為僮仆。取自脫一時之利，無顧趙氏社稷，為萬世慮計之意。」乃與其弟將卒攻殺王、太后及漢使者。遣人告蒼梧秦王及其諸郡縣，立明王長男越妻子術陽侯建德為王。而韓千秋兵入，破數小邑。其後越直開道給食，未至番禺四十里，越以兵擊千秋等，遂滅之。使人函封漢使者節置塞上，好為謾辭謝罪，發兵守要害處。於是天子曰：「韓千秋雖無成功，亦軍鋒之冠。」封其子延年為成安侯。樛樂，其姊為王太后，首願屬漢，封其子廣德為龍亢侯。乃下赦曰：「天子微，諸侯力政，譏臣不討賊。今呂嘉、建德等反，自立晏如，令罪人及江淮以南樓船十萬師往討之。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"g0x_vmx_2lg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"jfm_184_2yb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"王太后","kind":"person","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"王太后","kind":"person","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"呂嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"jfm_184_2yb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"莊參","kind":"person","person_id":"o6s_s07_5s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"參","kind":"person","person_id":"o6s_s07_5s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"g0x_vmx_2lg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0094","start":94,"end":95,"surface":"參","kind":"person","person_id":"o6s_s07_5s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0104","start":104,"end":107,"surface":"韓千秋","kind":"person","person_id":"8xz_mlj_r3c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c